{"id":"639273","name":"鸡腿煲仔饭","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/639273/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"4朵"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"圆白菜","amount":"半颗"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜、土豆、洋葱、圆白菜切丁。香菇切片。","img":"images/639273/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去骨鸡腿洗净下锅煮至7分熟。期间去浮沫。（鸡汤可以煮面）","img":"images/639273/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡腿凉凉切块。","img":"images/639273/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅加油加冰糖。","img":"images/639273/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"冰糖融化变色加入鸡腿肉翻炒均匀。","img":"images/639273/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入胡萝卜。","img":"images/639273/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入香菇。","img":"images/639273/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入土豆。","img":"images/639273/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀关火。","img":"images/639273/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"电饭锅装如此好的大米，加水量和平时煮饭的差不多。喜欢软口的略多一点点就好。","img":"images/639273/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"炒好的配菜一同加入。按下煮饭键。","img":"images/639273/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮饭的时候调酱汁。生抽、老抽、蚝油、胡椒粉、姜粉、葱花、糖、香油拌匀备用。","img":"images/639273/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"煮好了。","img":"images/639273/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"铺上圆白菜。","img":"images/639273/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"淋上酱汁。","img":"images/639273/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"稍微拌一下。再次盖盖子按下快煮键。","img":"images/639273/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好啦！鸡腿版的煲仔饭就出轨啦！","img":"images/639273/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/639273/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"一起吃饭吧！","img":"images/639273/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}